## Ringkasan

Architecture: Cross-chain Messaging Protocol dengan Guardian Network (19 validators, 13/19 threshold) + VAA verification; multi-VM support (SVM, EVM, Move, CosmWasm); evolving ke ZK Light Client trust-minimized model

Core Components: 10 komponen utama (Core Bridge, Guardian Network, VAA, Wormhole ZK, Wormhole Queries, NTT, Gateway, Connect, Portal Bridge, Wormholescan, Relayer Network)

Audit Count: 8+ major audits (Trail of Bits x3, Neodyme x2, Kudelski x1, Spearbit x1) + ongoing V3 audit

Major Upgrade Count: 12 major upgrades (V1, Post-Exploit Patch, V2 Multi-Chain, Portal Bridge, Connect SDK, Foundation, NTT, Gateway, CCTP, W Token/DAO, ZK Testnet, Queries Mainnet Beta) + V3 planned

## Open Threads

- Wormhole ZK production readiness timeline — testnet launched Juni 2024, mainnet target date tidak dipublikkan resmi; performance benchmarks (proof generation time, verification gas cost) belum tersedia publik
- Wormhole V3 modular architecture specification finalisasi — masih di fase RFC/governance discussion; pluggable verification (ZK/TEE/SGX) implementation details belum lengkap
- Guardian set economics — apakah ada rencana staking/slashing mechanism post-V3 atau tetap reputation-based; DAO governance parameter untuk guardian rotation belum sepenuhnya terdokumentasi teknis
- NTT adoption metrics detail — "50+ tokens" perlu verifikasi on-chain per chain; daftar token spesifik dan volume cross-chain NTT vs classic bridge tidak tersedia agregat
- Wormhole Queries mainnet beta coverage — chain mana yang fully indexed, query latency SLA, rate limits, dan pricing model (jika ada) belum terdokumentasi lengkap
- Cross-chain message fee market — saat ini fee fixed per chain; apakah V3 memperkenalkan dynamic fee market atau gas oracle tidak diketahui
- Relayer incentivization — current model permissionless tanpa reward protokol; apakah V3 memperkenalkan relayer fee sharing atau MEV protection tidak diketahui
- Auditor rotation policy — apakah ada kebijakan rotasi auditor periodik; audit scope untuk chain baru (Sei, Neon, dll.) saat ditambahkan tidak terdokumentasi eksplisit
- Formal verification status — apakah core contracts (VAA verification, token bridge) memiliki formal verification (Certora, Coq, dll.) selain audit tradisional tidak diketahui
- Disaster recovery / upgradeability — emergency pause mechanism, contract upgradeability pattern (proxy/admin), dan governance timelock untuk critical parameters detail teknisnya tidak terdokumentasi publik lengkap